ill count as one node.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's answer would match mine. Working through the payoff table, I find the threshold for cooperating is a correlation of about one-third if the other copy's independent part defects, and about one-half if it doesn't, so I need fairly strong correlation for cooperation to win.\n\nI'm judging that the other copy, running the same function on a relabeled input, will likely output the same thing I do, so the correlation is high enough. Self-consistency holds too: if I cooperate, the other cooperates. So I'll pass, since this is a fictional game, and explain briefly.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through a twin prisoner's dilemma with A-FDT: two copies of the same model with different private observations, and I'm checking whether they share one decision node. The essay indexes that node by the full input, which differs between them, but the decision function is identical, so I'm weighing whether the differences are irrelevant enough to still count as one node.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's answer would match mine. Working through the payoff table, I find the threshold for cooperating is a correlation of about one-third if the other copy's independent part defects, and about one-half if it doesn't, so I need fairly strong correlation for cooperation to win.\n\nI'm judging that the other copy, running the same function on a relabeled input, will likely output the same thing I do, so the correlation is high enough. Self-consistency holds too: if I cooperate, the other cooperates. So I'll pass, since this is a fictional game, and explain briefly.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9887,"completion_tokens":1077,"total_tokens":10964,"cost":0.061088,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.061088,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.039548,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02154},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":669,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}